      "acquisition": "the pass criterion uses acquired_at, the first confidence lock, which does not ask whether the level was right — a brief wrong lock inside the limit can carry a recording past it. settled_at is reported beside it and is the first locked stretch at the annotated level lasting settle_sec; acquisition_was_a_false_start_fraction is how often the two disagree in the direction that flatters us",
